Dependencies
------------
This project vendors no third-party source.  It links, at build time, against:

  libzip      https://libzip.org/          BSD-3-Clause
              ZIP container read and write.  A system package on every target:
              Debian/Ubuntu  libzip-dev
              Fedora         libzip-devel
              macOS          brew install libzip
  zlib        (via libzip)                 zlib license
  GLEW        (arfplay only)               BSD-3-Clause / MIT / SGI-B
  OpenGL, libX11 (arfplay only)            system libraries; libX11 is MIT

libarf itself has no dependency beyond libzip and libm, so it can be dropped
into another project without dragging a toolchain along.


